own set. True recall needs an INDEPENDENTLY-GENERATED reference universe (concept query + registry enumeration, not the seed list); that rebuild is in progress. Recovery is also search REACH, not inclusion — whether a recovered trial is eligible/poolable is the screen's and extractor's job.</p><h4>Registry landscape &amp; unpublished evidence (AACT)</h4><p>Of <strong>23</strong> registry records matching the query (broad — reach, not precision): 11 have a linked publication; <strong>0</strong> have posted CT.gov results but no publication (<em>poolable unpublished data no published meta in this topic has</em>); 5 are completed &ge;12 months ago with neither results nor a linked publication — a <em>loose upper bound</em> on non-publication, inflated by the broad enumeration and by NCT&rarr;PMID linkage misses, not a publication-bias claim. <span class='muted'>AACT 2026-08-30 (local snapshot).</span></p><h4>PubMed</h4><pre class='query'>(Balanced Crystalloids[Title] AND Saline[Title] AND Critically Ill Adults[Title] AND 2018[dp] AND &quot;N Engl J Med&quot;[jour]) OR (Balanced Multielectrolyte Solution[Title] AND Saline[Title] AND Critically Ill Adults[Title]) OR (Intravenous Fluid Treatment[Title] AND Balanced Solution[Title] AND Saline Solution[Title] AND Mortality[Title] AND Critically Ill Patients[Title])</pre><pre class='query'>(Buffered Crystalloid Solution[Title] AND Saline[Title] AND Acute Kidney Injury[Title] AND Intensive Care Unit[Title] AND JAMA[jour]) OR (Balanced Crystalloids[Title] AND Saline[Title] AND Intensive Care Unit[Title] AND SALT[Title])</pre><pre class='query'>(multicentre randomised controlled pilot[Title] AND Plasma-Lyte 148[Title]) OR (Saline[Title] AND Plasma-Lyte A[Title] AND trauma patients[Title])</pre><h4>ClinicalTrials.gov</h4><pre class='query'>{&quot;cond&quot;: &quot;critical illness&quot;, &quot;intr&quot;: &quot;balanced crystalloids&quot;}</pre></section><section class="tab" id="tab-screening"><h3 class="tabname">Screening</h3><