 or effect with confidence interval; the 36 versus 21 counts refer to adverse events.</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness: eligible+completed+results_available</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness basis: CT.gov status/results dates from local AACT snapshot</span><br><code>RETRIEVED_REFUSED_WITH_REASON</code><br><span class='muted'>harm span: Adverse events occurred in 21 patients (11.7%) in the placebo group vs 36 (20.0%) in the colchicine group (absolute difference, 8.3%; 95% CI; 0.76%-15.9%; number needed to harm = 12), but discontinuation rates were similar.</span></td></tr><tr><td>NCT07611019</td><td>NCT07611019</td><td class='absent-cell'>HM: source not retrieved</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract<br><code>SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED</code><br><span class='muted'>reason-code audit: <code>NOT_VERIFIABLE</code></span><br><span class='muted'>basis: SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED: cached abstract text is missing for this record</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness: eligible+completed+results_unavailable</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness basis: publication record / committed cache metadata</span><br><code>NOT_RETRIEVED</code></td></tr><tr><td>NCT07287345</td><td>NCT07287345</td><td class='absent-cell'>HM: source not retrieved</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract<br><code>SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED</code><br><span class='muted'>reason-code audit: <code>NOT_VERIFIABLE</code></span><br><span class='muted'>basis: SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED: cached abstract text is missing for this record</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness: eligible+completed+results_unavailable</span><br><span class='muted'>completeness basis: publication record / committed cache metadata</span><br><code>NOT_RETRIEVED</code></td></tr></table></section><section class="tab" id="tab-comparator"><h3 class="tabname">Comparator</h3><table class='kv'><tr><th>Published comparator</t