td><td>none (n=unknown; remainder=unknown)</td><td>yes</td></tr><tr><td>PUBMED_LEGACY_QUERY</td><td><code>Effect[Title] AND Finerenone[Title] AND Albuminuria[Title] AND Diabetic Nephropathy[Title] AND 2015[Date - Publication]</code></td><td>2026-09-11</td><td><strong>RAN_UNRECORDED</strong>: attempted by a pre-ledger fetch; its yield was never recorded, so neither a count nor a zero can be shown (legacy only — a live run may not carry this state)</td><td>unknown -&gt; 0 -&gt; 0</td><td>none (n=unknown; remainder=unknown)</td><td>yes</td></tr><tr><td>LEGACY_UNRECORDED</td><td><code>Effect[Title] AND Finerenone[Title] AND Chronic Kidney Disease Outcomes[Title] AND Type 2 Diabetes[Title] AND 2020[Date - Publication] || Cardiovascular Events[Title] AND Finerenone[Title] AND Kidney Disease[Title] AND Type 2 Diabetes[Title] AND 2021[Date - Publication] || Effect[Title] AND Finerenone[Title] AND Albuminuria[Title] AND Diabetic Nephropathy[Title] AND 2015[Date - Publication]</code></td><td>2026-09-11</td><td><strong>RAN_OK</strong>: ran and returned records</td><td>unknown -&gt; 5 -&gt; 5</td><td>none (n=unknown; remainder=unknown)</td><td>no</td></tr></table><h4>Source status (which adapters ran)</h4><p class='muted'>Citation chase: <strong>NOT_RUN</strong> · ClinicalTrials.gov: <strong>RAN_OK</strong> · Europe PMC (OA + metadata): <strong>RAN_OK</strong> · Legacy unrecorded retrieval: <strong>RAN_OK</strong> · PMC full text: <strong>NOT_RUN</strong> · PubMed: <strong>RAN_OK</strong> · Registry-first (AACT): <strong>RAN_OK</strong> — RAN_OK = ran and returned records; RAN_ZERO = ran, none matched; RAN_ERROR = attempted but failed; NOT_RUN = not attempted for this topic.</p><h4>Retrieval class</h4><div class='absent'><p><strong>TITLE-SEEDED RETRIEVAL — DISCOVERY-BIASED, NOT A SYSTEMATIC SEARCH</strong> We retract any claim of a registry-first or systematic search for this topic. an auditable screening ledger attached to an unauditable retrieval process.</p></div><table clas