imary</td><td></td><td>not a randomized controlled trial (record: NCT07717697).</td><td class='span'>publication types: (no publication types)</td></tr></table><h4>Controls</h4><ul><li><strong>Positive:</strong> Recovered &amp; included the canonical trials [&#x27;33264825&#x27;, &#x27;34449181&#x27;, &#x27;26325557&#x27;] that a comparator includes; none missed.</li><li><strong>Negative:</strong> Cross-topic trial(s) [&#x27;39225278&#x27;] recovered by the search and correctly EXCLUDED [&#x27;39225278&#x27;] by rule (same drug/design, wrong topic).</li></ul></section><section class="tab" id="tab-outcomes"><h3 class="tabname">Results</h3><div class='audit-block'><h3>Reason-code audit</h3><p><strong>0 of 13</strong> declared-absent/refusal reason code(s) have a numeric value in a held source; 4 wrong-kind code(s); 6 not verifiable from held sources. Registered-outcome sweep: 0 of 15 included-trial/outcome pair(s) are held-but-not-extracted.</p><table class='arms'><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Code</th><th>Audit verdict</th><th>Held source</th></tr><tr><td>NCT07775846</td><td>Kidney composite outcome</td><td><code>SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED</code></td><td><strong>NOT_VERIFIABLE</strong></td><td>no held source</td></tr><tr><td>NCT07026539</td><td>Kidney composite outcome</td><td><code>SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED</code></td><td><strong>NOT_VERIFIABLE</strong></td><td>no held source</td></tr><tr><td>33264825</td><td>Hyperkalemia</td><td><code>REFUSED_ON_EVIDENCE</code></td><td><strong>REASON_WRONG_KIND</strong></td><td>value absent from held source, but the code names a value-present/refusal cause</td></tr><tr><td>34449181</td><td>Hyperkalemia</td><td><code>REFUSED_ON_EVIDENCE</code></td><td><strong>REASON_WRONG_KIND</strong></td><td>value absent from held source, but the code names a value-present/refusal cause</td></tr><tr><td>NCT07775846</td><td>Hyperkalemia</td><td><code>SOURCE_NOT_RETRIEVED</code></td><td><strong>NOT_VERIFIABLE</strong></td><td>no held source</td></tr><t