tr><tr><td>28304224</td><td>Major adverse cardiovascular events</td><td>FOURIER: 5-point primary (adds unstable angina, revascularization). ·both families</td><td><strong>DISCLOSED (composite-heterogeneity note)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>30403574</td><td>Major adverse cardiovascular events</td><td>ODYSSEY: 4-point primary (adds unstable angina requiring hospitalization). ·both families</td><td><strong>DISCLOSED (composite-heterogeneity note)</strong></td></tr></table></div><div class='audit-block'><h3>Reason-code audit</h3><p><strong>1 of 11</strong> declared-absent/refusal reason code(s) have a numeric value in a held source; 2 wrong-kind code(s); 0 not verifiable from held sources. Registered-outcome sweep: 1 of 15 included-trial/outcome pair(s) are held-but-not-extracted.</p><table class='arms'><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Code</th><th>Audit verdict</th><th>Held source</th></tr><tr><td>25773378</td><td>Major adverse cardiovascular events</td><td><code>outcome_post_hoc_not_pooled</code></td><td><strong>REASON_FALSE_VALUE_HELD</strong></td><td>abstract:25773378<br><span class='muted'>In a post hoc analysis, the rate of major adverse cardiovascular events (death from coronary heart disease, nonfatal myocardial infarction, fatal or nonfatal ischemic stroke, or unstable angina requiring hospitalization) was lower with ali...</span></td></tr><tr><td>28304224</td><td>Injection-site reactions</td><td><code>REFUSED_ON_EVIDENCE</code></td><td><strong>REASON_WRONG_KIND</strong></td><td>value absent from held source, but the code names a value-present/refusal cause</td></tr><tr><td>30403574</td><td>Injection-site reactions</td><td><code>REFUSED_ON_EVIDENCE</code></td><td><strong>REASON_WRONG_KIND</strong></td><td>value absent from held source, but the code names a value-present/refusal cause</td></tr></table></div><div data-primary-result='true'><h4>Major adverse cardiovascular events (primary)</h4><table class='kv'><tr><th>Estimand</th><td>HR</td></tr><tr><th>Estim